    "turn_text": "No, no, I mean, it is a legitimate question, right? And those of us who seek to be hopeful, ask these questions ourselves all the time. But we are also honest people. And you can't go after change if you are not rooted in truth and reality. And the reality at the moment is that the state of our nation, our politics, is devoid of courage and an ability to really understand what is it that people are mobilizing for and against. It does get exhausting. for those of us who come from communities that live on the margins of society, to constantly be in the process of explaining our plight",
