    "turn_idx": 38,
    "turn_text": "I know the media has presented these words to you, these threats to you. They've asked you to comment on his nastiness and his xenophobia. But what I'm interested in as a mother of three, as a person of compassion, as a woman of color in this country, What do his words make you feel, not just when you're on camera or speaking publicly, but when you're at home with yourself, with your family?",
